    "summary": "init should own a managed .gitattributes section the same way it owns .gitignore rules: mark .slop/db/** linguist-generated (GitHub) and gitlab-generated (GitLab) so tracker files collapse in PR/MR diffs, plus the LF-enforcement rule for .slop/db JSONC. Idempotent re-runs, append-don't-clobber user content, tests + docs (getting-started, configuration).",
